  "validity": "valid",
  "shapes": [
    "address-credentials-with-delegates",
    "nested-delegates",
    "custom-account"
  ],
  "why": "SOROBAN_CREDENTIALS_ADDRESS_WITH_DELEGATES carries delegate signatures, and each delegate may carry nested delegates. Here the authorizing custom account forwards to its delegate, which forwards to its own delegate: three __check_auth calls, one nonce (the authorizing account's). Readers built on older XDR fail to decode the credentials; readers that treat delegates as authorizers with nonces misreport them.",
